flowchart TD
    Start[Launch Foundation.exe] --> Auth[Steam Auth Check<br>(Error if No Account)]
    Auth --> Detect[Auto-Detect Render Backends<br>(OpenGL/Vulkan/DX)<br>Fallback: OpenGL]
    Detect --> Settings[Settings Menu<br>(Toggle Renderer, Save Config)]
    Settings --> RenderLauncher[Spawn Trebuchet Window<br>(Static 2D Menu via Engine/HTMLUI)]
    RenderLauncher --> Tabs[Display Tabs: Create/Play/Edit<br>(Load Workshop Extensions)]
    Tabs -->|Create| CreateFlow[Select Game Type (2D/3D Variants)<br>Server Options (Solo/P2P/Hosted)<br>Generate VS sln/Project]
    CreateFlow -->|Free| Workshop[Publish to Workshop]
    CreateFlow -->|Paid| License[Dev License Check<br>Then Standalone Export]
    Tabs -->|Play| PlayFlow[Browse Lobbies/Friends<br>Launch Game Instance<br>(Load Mods, Multiplayer)]
    Tabs -->|Edit| EditFlow[Open CastleBuilder<br>(Asset Import, Level Edit, Script Hooks to VS Code)]
    EditFlow --> Save[Save/Publish Changes]